  "description": "Concrete implementation of the Inoxie API services layer focused on identifiers based on text strings (`StringId`). Building on abstractions provided by `Inoxie.Tools.ApiServices.StringId.Abstractions`, this project delivers actual methods and classes that facilitate interaction with data using `StringId` identifiers. It collaborates with other Inoxie tools, including data repositories and processors, to ensure consistency and efficiency in the API services ecosystem.",
